{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17997","headline":"洞庭湖阻风赠张十一署 · 韩愈","name":"洞庭湖阻风赠张十一署","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十月阴气盛，北风无时休。\n苍茫洞庭岸，与子维双舟。\n雾雨晦争泄，波涛怒相投。\n犬鸡断四听，粮绝谁与谋。\n相去不容步，险如碍山丘。\n清谈可以饱，梦想接无由。\n男女喧左右，饥啼但啾啾。\n非怀北归兴，何用胜羇愁。\n云外有白日，寒光自悠悠。\n能令暂开霁，过是吾无求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}